## ADDITIONAL NOTICES  (these do not modify the MIT terms above)

**SAFETY**

    This Software is a simulation and test tool. It is not intended for use
    in safety-critical systems, in certification or homologation, or in or on
    any vehicle operated on public roads. It transmits data on a CAN bus and
    must not be connected to a vehicle in motion, or to any system where a
    malfunction could cause injury or damage.

